    "Bolus snooze is enacted after you do a meal bolus, so the loop won’t counteract with low temps when you’ve just eaten. The example here and default is 2, so a 3 hour DIA means that bolus snooze will be gradually phased out over 1.5 hours (3DIA/2).": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze is enacted after you do a meal bolus, so the loop won’t counteract with low temps when you’ve just eaten. The example here and default is 2, so a 3 hour DIA means that bolus snooze will be gradually phased out over 1.5 hours (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Задержка болюса активируется после болюса на еду, чтобы алгоритм не противодействовал низкими временными базалами сразу после еды. Значение по умолчанию — 2, то есть при DIA 3 часа задержка будет постепенно снижаться в течение 1.5 часов (3/2)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bolus snooze is enacted after you do a meal bolus, so the loop won’t counteract with low temps when you’ve just eaten. The example here and default is 2; so a 3 hour DIA means that bolus snooze will be gradually phased out over 1.5 hours (3DIA/2).": {
      "comment": "Bolus Snooze DIA Divisor",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze is enacted after you do a meal bolus, so the loop won’t counteract with low temps when you’ve just eaten. The example here and default is 2; so a 3 hour DIA means that bolus snooze will be gradually phased out over 1.5 hours (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze is enacted after you do a meal bolus, so the loop won’t counteract with low temps when you’ve just eaten. The example here and default is 2; so a 3 hour DIA means that bolus snooze will be gradually phased out over 1.5 hours (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze is enacted after you do a meal bolus, so the loop won’t counteract with low temps when you’ve just eaten. The example here and default is 2; so a 3 hour DIA means that bolus snooze will be gradually phased out over 1.5 hours (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze wird nach einem Mahlzeitenbolus gestartet, so dass der Loop nicht konterkariert wird, wenn der BZ einen niedrigen Werten hat und Sie gerade gegessen haben. Beispiel: Standard ist 2; also bedeutet ein 3 Stunden DIA, dass Bolus snooze nach und nach über 1,5 Stunden abgegeben wird (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze is enacted after you do a meal bolus, so the loop won’t counteract with low temps when you’ve just eaten. The example here and default is 2; so a 3 hour DIA means that bolus snooze will be gradually phased out over 1.5 hours (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El retardo de bolos se realiza después de suministrar un bolo para comer, para que el Lazo no contrarreste con basales temporales bajas cuando acaba de comer. Por ejemplo, con el valor predeterminado de 2, y siendo la duración de la insulina activa (DIA) de 3 horas, el retardo del del bolo se realizará gradualmente durante 1.5 horas (3DIA % 2)."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze is enacted after you do a meal bolus, so the loop won’t counteract with low temps when you’ve just eaten. The example here and default is 2; so a 3 hour DIA means that bolus snooze will be gradually phased out over 1.5 hours (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze est activé apres votre bolus de repas, la boucle ne réagira pas avec des valeurs basses temporaire quand vous venez juste de manger. L’exemple ici et la valeur par défaut est 2 ; donc avec une Durée d'Action (DIA) de 3 heures signifie que snooze bolus sera graduellement éliminé après 1,5 heures (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze is enacted after you do a meal bolus, so the loop won’t counteract with low temps when you’ve just eaten. The example here and default is 2; so a 3 hour DIA means that bolus snooze will be gradually phased out over 1.5 hours (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze è attivato dopo un bolo pasto per fare in modo che il loop non imposti basali temporanee basse quando hai appena mangiato. L’esempio qui sotto prende il valore di default di 2; Con DIA di 3 ore \"bolus snooze\" durerà 1.5 ore (3/2)."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze is enacted after you do a meal bolus, so the loop won’t counteract with low temps when you’ve just eaten. The example here and default is 2; so a 3 hour DIA means that bolus snooze will be gradually phased out over 1.5 hours (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bolus snooze is geactiveerd nadat je een maaltijdbolus hebt gedaan, zodat de Loop geen lage streefwaardes zal instellen wanneer je net hebt gegeten. Het voorbeeld hier en de standaard waarde is 2; dus een DIA van 3 uur betekent dat bolus snooze geleidelijk aan zal verdwijnen binnen 1,5 uur (3DIA/2)."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
