    "Default value: 0.5 This is another key OpenAPS safety cap, and specifies what share of the total insulin required can be delivered as SMB. This is to prevent people from getting into dangerous territory by setting SMB requests from the caregivers phone at the same time. Increase this experimental value slowly and with caution.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default value: 0.5 This is another key OpenAPS safety cap, and specifies what share of the total insulin required can be delivered as SMB. This is to prevent people from getting into dangerous territory by setting SMB requests from the caregivers phone at the same time. Increase this experimental value slowly and with caution."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Значение по умолчанию: 0.5. Это важное ограничение безопасности OpenAPS, определяющее какую долю от общего необходимого инсулина можно доставить через SMB. Это предотвращает опасные ситуации при одновременных запросах SMB. Увеличивайте это экспериментальное значение медленно и осторожно."
          }
        }
      }
    },
