    "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means FreeAPS X will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications from the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night.": {
      "comment": "Skip Neutral Temps",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standardmäßig aus, damit FreeAPS X, wann immer es möglich ist, Temps festlegt, sodass Sie leichter sehen können, ob das System funktioniert, selbst wenn Sie offline sind. Dies bedeutet, dass OpenAPS eine „neutrale“ Temp (wie Ihre Standard-Basalrate) einstellt, wenn keine Anpassungen erforderlich sind. Dies ist eine alte Einstellung für OpenAPS, um die Optionen zum Minimieren von Geräuschen und Benachrichtigungen aus dem 'Rig' zu haben, die Sie während der Nacht aufwecken können. "
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por defecto es falso, por lo que FreeAPS X establecerá basales temporales siempre que pueda, por lo que será más fácil ver si el sistema está funcionando, incluso cuando esté fuera de línea. Esto significa que OpenAPS establecerá una basal temporal “neutral” (igual que su basal por defecto) si no se necesitan ajustes. Esta es una configuración antigua para que OpenAPS tenga las opciones para minimizar sonidos y notificaciones del 'rig', que puede despertarte durante la noche. "
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La valeur par défaut est faux, de sorte que FreeAPS X définisse une valeur basal dès qu'il le peut, donc il sera plus facile de voir si le système fonctionne, même lorsque vous êtes hors ligne. Cela signifie qu'OpenAPS définira une valeur basale « neutre » (identique à votre basal par défaut) si aucun ajustement n'est nécessaire. Ceci est un ancien paramètre d'OpenAPS afin de minimiser les sons et les notifications de la 'rig', qui pouvaient vous réveiller pendant la nuit. "
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I valori predefiniti sono falsi, in modo che FreeAPS X imposterà basali temporanee ogni volta che è possibile, così sarà più facile vedere se il sistema funziona, anche quando sei offline. Ciò significa che OpenAPS imposterà una basale temporanea “neutrale” (uguale alla basale predefinita) se non sono necessarie modifiche. Questa è una vecchia impostazione per OpenAPS per avere le opzioni per minimizzare i suoni e le notifiche del dispositivo, che può svegliarti durante la notte. "
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standaard ingesteld op uit, zodat FreeAPS X tijdelijke basaal waardes zal instellen wanneer dat maar kan. het zal dus makkelijker zijn om te zien of het systeem werkt, zelfs als je offline bent. Dit betekent dat OpenAPS een \"neutraal\" basaal (hetzelfde als jouw standaard basaal) zal instellen als er geen aanpassingen nodig zijn. Dit is een oude instelling van OpenAPS om de optie te hebben om geluiden en meldingen te beperken waarvan je 's nachts misschien wakker kan worden. "
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "По умолчанию значение false, так что OpenAPS будет устанавливать временные цели когда это возможно,  так будет проще увидеть, работает ли система даже в автономном режиме. Эта настройка означает, что OpenAPS установит «нейтральную» ВБС (такую же, как и исходная база по умолчанию), если изменения не нужны. Это старая настройка OpenAPS для минимизации звуков и уведомлений на помпе."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Av som standard, så att FreeAPS X kan ställa in temporära basaldoser närhelst den kan, vilket gör det lättare att se ifall systemet fungerar, även när du är offline. Detta innebär att FreeAPS X kommer att ställa in en ”neutral” temporär basal (samma som din ordinarie basal) när inga justeringar behövs. Gammal inställning från OpenAPS för att minska ljud och notiser mitt i natten från dessa 'rigs'. Vi rekommenderar att man lämnar neutrala temporära basaler aktiverade. "
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Varsayılan olarak kapalı olarak ayarlıdır, böylece FreeAPS X mümkün olduğu kadar geçici süreler ayarlayacaktır, böylece çevrimdışı olduğunuzda bile sistemin çalışıp çalışmadığını görmek daha kolay olacaktır. Bu herhangi bir ayar gerekmiyorsa OpenAPS'nin \"nötr\" bir geçeci bazal ayarlayacağı (varsayılan bazalınızla aynı) anlamına gelir. Bu OpenAPS'in sizi gece uyandırabilecek \"rig\"tan gelen sesleri ve bildirimleri en aza indirme seçeneklerine sahip olduğu eski bir ayardır. "
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that FreeAPS X will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. This is an old setting for OpenAPS to have the options to minimise sounds and notifications form the 'rig', that may wake you up during the night. "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认禁用，这样FreeAPS X就会在任何时候设置临时目标，这样就会更容易看到系统是否在工作，即使你不在线。这意味着如果不需要调整，OpenAPS将设置一个 \"中性 \"临时基础（与你的默认基础相同）。这是OpenAPS的一个旧设置，可以选择最大限度地减少 \"设备 \"的声音和通知，这些声音和通知可能会在夜间吵醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Defaults to false, so that OpenAPS will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. If you are a light sleeper and the “on the hour” buzzing or beeping wakes you up (even in vibrate mode), you may want to turn this to “true” to skip setting neutral temps. However, we recommend leaving neutral temps enabled for most people who will be using this system on the go and out of constant connectivity.\n\nNote: if set to true, in order to reduce notifications at the top of the hour, it will also attempt to cancel temp basals (unless BG or minGuardBG is below threshold and a zero-temp is needed) prior to the top of the hour. Normally a new temp basal will be set (if still needed) after the top of the hour, but that may be delayed if the rig has issues connecting to the pump. People who want to minimize the ‘on the hour’ temp basal notification beeps/vibrations may choose to accept that risk and choose to set skip_neutral_temps to true.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, so that OpenAPS will set temps whenever it can, so it will be easier to see if the system is working, even when you are offline. This means OpenAPS will set a “neutral” temp (same as your default basal) if no adjustments are needed. If you are a light sleeper and the “on the hour” buzzing or beeping wakes you up (even in vibrate mode), you may want to turn this to “true” to skip setting neutral temps. However, we recommend leaving neutral temps enabled for most people who will be using this system on the go and out of constant connectivity.\n\nNote: if set to true, in order to reduce notifications at the top of the hour, it will also attempt to cancel temp basals (unless BG or minGuardBG is below threshold and a zero-temp is needed) prior to the top of the hour. Normally a new temp basal will be set (if still needed) after the top of the hour, but that may be delayed if the rig has issues connecting to the pump. People who want to minimize the ‘on the hour’ temp basal notification beeps/vibrations may choose to accept that risk and choose to set skip_neutral_temps to true."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "По умолчанию выключено — OpenAPS будет устанавливать временные базалы когда возможно, чтобы было видно, что система работает, даже офлайн. Это означает, что OpenAPS установит «нейтральный» временный базал (равный вашему обычному), если корректировка не нужна. Если вы чутко спите и звуки «в начале часа» вас будят, можете включить эту опцию.\n\nПримечание: если включено, для уменьшения уведомлений система попытается отменить временные базалы перед началом часа (если не требуется нулевой базал из-за низкого ГК)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Defaults to false, which means by default only the low end of the pump's BG target range is used as OpenAPS target. This is a safety feature to prevent too-wide targets and less-optimal outcomes. Therefore the higher end of the target range is used only for avoiding bolus wizard overcorrections. Use wide_bg_target_range: true to force neutral temps over a wider range of eventualBGs.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By default, OpenAPS targets only the lower end of your target range for tighter control. Enable this to use the full target range, which results in less frequent adjustments and a more relaxed approach."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "По умолчанию выключено — используется только нижняя граница целевого диапазона ГК помпы как цель OpenAPS. Это функция безопасности для предотвращения слишком широких целей. Верхняя граница используется только для избежания перекоррекции болюсным калькулятором. Включите для использования нейтральных базалов в более широком диапазоне прогнозируемых ГК."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Defaults to false, which means by default only the low end of the pump’s BG target range is used as OpenAPS target. This is a safety feature to prevent too-wide targets and less-optimal outcomes. Therefore the higher end of the target range is used only for avoiding bolus wizard overcorrections. Use wide_bg_target_range: true to force neutral temps over a wider range of eventualBGs.": {
      "comment": "Wide BG Target Range",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to false, which means by default only the low end of the pump’s BG target range is used as OpenAPS target. This is a safety feature to prevent too-wide targets and less-optimal outcomes. Therefore the higher end of the target range is used only for avoiding bolus wizard overcorrections. Use wide_bg_target_range: true to force neutral temps over a wider range of eventualBGs."
          }
        },
        "ca": {
