            "value": "默认禁用。当启用时，当Autosens检测到抵抗时，将降低血糖目标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs.": {
      "comment": "Max SMB Basal Minutes",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standardmäßiger beginn nach 30 Minuten. Dies ist das Maximum von Basalminuten, die als einzelne SMB mit ungedecktem COB geliefert werden können. Dies gibt die Möglichkeit, SMB aggressiver zu machen, wenn Sie es wünschen. Es wird empfohlen, dass der Wert auf 30 beginnt, entsprechend der Standardeinstellung und wenn Sie diesen Wert erhöhen tun Sie dies in höchstens 15 Minuten Schritten unter Beachtung der Auswirkungen der Änderungen. Es wird nicht empfohlen, diesen Wert höher als 90 Minuten zu setzen, da dies die Fähigkeit des Algorithmus beeinflussen kann, sicher Null Zeit zu setzen. Es wird auch empfohlen, dass Pushover verwendet wird, wenn der Wert größer als der Standardwert ist, so dass Warnungen für alle vorausgesagten Tief- oder Höchstwerte generiert werden."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controls the maximum size of a single SMB dose (calculated as X minutes of your basal rate). Start with 30 minutes. Increase by 15-minute steps if you need more aggressive dosing. Maximum recommended: 90 minutes. Higher values may prevent the system from stopping lows safely."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por defecto comienza en 30. Este es el máximo de minutos de basal que se puede entregar como un solo SMB con COB no cubiertos. Esto da la capacidad de hacer los SMB más agresivos si lo desea. Se recomienda que el valor se establezca a partir de 30, en línea con el valor predeterminado, y si decide aumentar este valor, hacerlo en incrementos de no más de 15 minutos, vigilando de cerca los efectos de los cambios. No se recomienda establecer este valor superior a 90 minutos, ya que esto puede afectar a la capacidad del algoritmo para poner suspender la basal temporalmente. Se recomienda también usar Pushover cuando se establezca un valor mayor que el predeterminado, para que las alarmas se generen para cualquier hipo o hiper prevista."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Par défaut, il faut démarrer à 30 minutes. Il s'agit de la durée maximale en minutes du niveau basal qui peuvent être livrées en tant que simple SMB avec des COB non couverts. Cela permet de rendre SMB plus agressif si vous le souhaitez. Il est recommandé que la valeur soit définie au départ à 30, conformément à la valeur par défaut, et si vous choisissez d'augmenter cette valeur, le faire par pas de 15 minutes et en gardant un œil attentif sur les effets des changements. Il n'est pas recommandé de définir cette valeur supérieure à 90 mins, car cela peut affecter la capacité de l'algorithme."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Predefinito per iniziare a 30 minuti. Questo è il massimo di minuti di basale che possono essere somministrati come un singolo SMB con COB non coperti. Questo dà la possibilità di rendere SMB più aggressivo se viene selezionato. Si raccomanda che il valore sia impostato per iniziare a 30, in linea con il valore predefinito, e se si sceglie di aumentare questo valore, farlo con incrementi non superiori a 15 minuti, facendo grande attenzione agli effetti dei cambiamenti. Non è consigliabile impostare questo valore oltre a 90 minuti, in quanto ciò potrebbe influire sulla capacità dell'algoritmo di azzerare in sicurezza la basale temporanea. Si raccomanda inoltre di utilizzare il pushover quando si imposta un valore maggiore di quello predefinito, in modo che le siano generati in anticipo avvertimenti per alti o bassi valori glicemici predetti."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Staat standaard op 30. Dit is het maximum aantal minuten van basaal dat kan worden toegediend als een enkele supermicrobolus (SMB) zonder dat dit compenseert wordt door COB. Dit zorgt er voor dat SMB agressiever kan worden ingesteld, als je daarvoor kiest. Het is aanbevolen om te beginnen met een waarde van 30 minuten, de standaard waarde en als je er voor kiest om de waarde te verhogen dat je dit met niet grotere stappen doet dan stappen van 15 minuten. Het is niet aanbevolen om het hoger dan 90 minuten in te stellen, dit beperkt de mogelijkheid van het algoritme om veilig een tijdelijk 0 basaal in te stellen. Het wordt ook aanbevolen om push berichten aan te zetten voor wanneer de glucose waardes hoog of laag dreigen te raken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Максимальный размер одной дозы SMB (рассчитывается как X минут базала). Начните с 30 минут. Увеличивайте шагами по 15 минут при необходимости более агрессивного дозирования. Максимум: 90 минут — большие значения могут помешать системе предотвратить гипогликемию."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standardvärde 30. Detta är det maximala antal minuter av din ordinarie basal som kommer att ges som en SMB. Denna inställning ger möjlighet att göra SMB större och behandlingen med SMB mer aggressiv. Det rekommenderas att börja med 30 minuter, och om du väljer att öka detta värde, göra det stegvis i högst 15 minuters steg, samtidigt som du noga följer effekterna av de nya inställningarna. Det rekommenderas inte att ställa in detta värde högre än 90 minuter, eftersom detta påverkar algoritmens förmåga att säkert kunna balansera med temporära basaler på 0 IE/h. Det rekommenderas också att pushover används när värdet sätts till att vara större än standard, så att varningar och notiser kan genereras för alla förväntade blodsockerdalar eller toppar."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Varsayılan değer 30'dan başlar. Bu, COB'u açık olmayan tek bir SMB olarak teslim edilebilecek maksimum bazal dakikadır. Bu isterseniz SMB'leri daha agresif hale getirme yeteneği verir. Değerin varsayılana uygun olarak 30'da başlayacak şekilde ayarlanması ve bu değeri artırmayı seçerseniz, değişikliklerin etkilerini yakından takip ederek bunu 15 dakikalık artışlarla yapmanız önerilir. Algoritmanın güvenli bir şekilde geçici bazal'ı sıfırlayabilme yeteneğini etkileyebileceğinden, bu değeri 90 dakikadan daha yükseğe ayarlamanız önerilmez. Ayrıca, değeri varsayılandan daha büyük olarak ayarlarken bildirim özelliğinin kullanılması önerilir, böylece tahmin edilen herhangi bir düşük veya yüksek seviye için uyarılar oluşturulur."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered as a single SMB with uncovered COB. This gives the ability to make SMB more aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 90 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认以30分钟为起点。这是在未覆盖COB的情况下，作为一个单一的SMB可以提供的最大分钟数的基础率。如果你选择的话，这可以使SMB更加积极。建议将该值设置为30，与默认值一致，如果你选择增加该值，以不超过15分钟为单位，密切关注变化的效果。不建议将这个值设置得高于90分钟，因为这可能会影响算法调整零基础率的能力。还建议在设置该值大于默认值时，使用PushOVer，以便对任何预测的低点或高点产生警报。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered by UAM as a single SMB when IOB exceeds COB. This gives the ability to make UAM more or less aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. Reducing the value will cause UAM to dose less insulin for each SMB. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 60 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs.": {
      "comment": "Max UAM SMB Basal Minutes",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered by UAM as a single SMB when IOB exceeds COB. This gives the ability to make UAM more or less aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. Reducing the value will cause UAM to dose less insulin for each SMB. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 60 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered by UAM as a single SMB when IOB exceeds COB. This gives the ability to make UAM more or less aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. Reducing the value will cause UAM to dose less insulin for each SMB. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 60 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered by UAM as a single SMB when IOB exceeds COB. This gives the ability to make UAM more or less aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. Reducing the value will cause UAM to dose less insulin for each SMB. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 60 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standardwerte für Start ist 30 Minuten. Dies ist die maximale Basal-Minuten, die von UAM als ein einziges SMB geliefert werden können, wenn IOB den COB übersteigt. Dies gibt die Möglichkeit, UAM mehr oder weniger aggressiv zu machen, wenn Sie es wünschen. Es wird empfohlen, dass der Wert nach 30 Minuten beginnt, entsprechend der Standardeinstellung und wenn Sie diesen Wert erhöhen tun Sie dies in höchstens 15 Minuten Schritten unter Beachtung der Auswirkungen der Änderungen. Eine Verringerung des Wertes führt dazu, dass UAM für jedes SMB weniger Insulin Dosis erhält. Es wird nicht empfohlen, diesen Wert höher als 60 Minuten zu setzen, da dies die Fähigkeit des Algorithmus beeinflussen kann, sicher Null Zeit zu setzen. Es wird auch empfohlen, dass Pushover verwendet wird, wenn der Wert größer als der Standardwert ist, so dass Warnungen für alle vorausgesagten Tief- oder Höchstwerte generiert werden."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered by UAM as a single SMB when IOB exceeds COB. This gives the ability to make UAM more or less aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. Reducing the value will cause UAM to dose less insulin for each SMB. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 60 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maximum SMB size for unannounced meals (when there's no COB). Lower values make UAM more cautious, higher values more aggressive. Start with 30, adjust slowly. Maximum recommended: 60 minutes."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por defecto comienza en 30. Este es el máximo de minutos de basal que UAM puede entregar como un solo SMB cuando la insulina activa excede los carbohidratos activos. Esto da la capacidad de hacer UAM más o menos agresivo si lo desea. Se recomienda que el valor se establezca a partir de 30, en línea con el valor predeterminado, y si decide aumentar este valor, hacerlo en incrementos de no más de 15 minutos, vigilando de cerca los efectos de los cambios. Reducir el valor hará que UAM inyecte menos insulina para cada SMB. No se recomienda establecer este valor superior a 60 minutos, ya que esto puede afectar a la capacidad del algoritmo de suspender la basal temporalmente. También se recomienda que Pushover sea usado cuando se establece que el valor es mayor de lo predeterminado, para que las alertas se generen para cualquier bajo o alto previsto."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered by UAM as a single SMB when IOB exceeds COB. This gives the ability to make UAM more or less aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. Reducing the value will cause UAM to dose less insulin for each SMB. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 60 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La valeur par défaut est à 30. Il s'agit de la durée maximale en minutes du niveau basal qui peuvent être délivrées par UAM en tant que SMB unique lorsque l'IOB dépasse COB. Cela donne la possibilité de rendre UAM plus ou moins agressif si vous le souhaitez. Il est recommandé que la valeur commence à 30, conformément à la valeur par défaut, et si vous choisissez d'augmenter cette valeur, le faire par pas de 15 minutes, en gardant un œil attentif sur les effets des changements. La réduction de la valeur entraînera à injecter moins d'insuline pour chaque SMB. Il n'est pas recommandé de définir cette valeur supérieure à 60 mins, car cela peut affecter la capacité de l'algorithme."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Defaults to start at 30. This is the maximum minutes of basal that can be delivered by UAM as a single SMB when IOB exceeds COB. This gives the ability to make UAM more or less aggressive if you choose. It is recommended that the value is set to start at 30, in line with the default, and if you choose to increase this value, do so in no more than 15 minute increments, keeping a close eye on the effects of the changes. Reducing the value will cause UAM to dose less insulin for each SMB. It is not recommended to set this value higher than 60 mins, as this may affect the ability for the algorithm to safely zero temp. It is also recommended that pushover is used when setting the value to be greater than default, so that alerts are generated for any predicted lows or highs."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Predefinito per iniziare a 30 minuti. Questo è il massimo minuti di basale che può essere somministrato da UAM come un singolo SMB quando IOB supera la COB. Questo dà la possibilità di rendere UAM più o meno aggressivo se viene attivato. Si raccomanda che il valore sia impostato per iniziare a 30, in linea con il valore predefinito, e se si sceglie di aumentare questo valore, farlo con incrementi non superiori a 15 minuti, tenendo un occhio attento agli effetti dei cambiamenti. La riduzione del valore causerà una riduzione della dose di insulina UAM per ogni SMB. Non è consigliabile impostare questo valore superiore a 60 minuti, in quanto ciò potrebbe influire sulla capacità dell'algoritmo di azzerare in sicurezza la basale temporanea. Si raccomanda inoltre di utilizzare il pushover quando si imposta un valore maggiore di quello predefinito, in modo che vengano eseguite segnalazioni in anticipo per valori glicemi predetti alti o bassi."
          }
        },
