    "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended.": {
      "comment": "Unsuspend If No Temp",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Viele Menschen vergessen gelegentlich ihre Pumpe fortzusetzen / pausieren nach der Wiederanbindung der Pumpe. Wenn du einer von ihnen bist und bereit bist eine Null-Temp Basal zu setzen, wann immer du deine Pumpe pausierst und getrennt hast, kann diese Funktion hilfreich sein. Wenn diese Option aktiviert ist, wird die Pumpe automatisch fortgesetzt/pausiert, wenn Sie dies vergessen haben, bevor Ihre Null-Temp abläuft. Solange die Null-Temp noch läuft, wird die Pumpe ausgesetzt."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muchas personas de vez en cuando se olvidan de reanudar / dejar de suspender su bomba después de volver a conectarla. Si es uno de ellos, y está dispuesto a establecer de manera fiable una basal temporal cero unidades cada vez que suspenda y desconecte su bomba esta característica es para usted. Si está activado, se reanudará / des-suspenderá automáticamente la bomba si se olvida de hacerlo antes de que expire la basal temporal de cero unidades. Mientras la basal temporal de cero unidades siga funcionando, dejará la bomba suspendida."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De nombreuses personnes oublient parfois de reprendre / désuspendre leur pompe après la reconnexion. Si vous êtes l'un d'eux, et que vous êtes définissez un basal temporaire à zéro chaque fois que vous suspendez ou débranchez votre pompe, cette fonction peut être pertinente. Si cette option est activée, elle reprendra automatiquement le basal en cours si vous oubliez de reprendre votre pompe. Tant que la valeur temporaire de basal est de zéro, elle laissera la pompe suspendue."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Molte persone di tanto in tanto dimenticano di riprendere / rimuovere la sospensione del microinfusore dopo averlo riconnesso. Se sei uno di loro, e si è disposti a impostare in modo affidabile una basale temporanea zero ogni volta che sospende e scollega la pompa, questa funzione ha un senso. Se abilitata, ripristinerà automaticamente / annullerà la sospensione del microinfusore se lo dimentichi prima che scada la basale temporanea zero. Finché la basale temporanea zero è ancora in funzione, lascerà la pompa sospesa."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Veel mensen vergeten af en toe hun pomp te hervatten nadat ze opnieuw zijn aangesloten. Herken je jezelf hierin en ben je bereid voordat je je afkoppelt een tijdelijk basaal van 0 in te stellen kan deze instelling helpen. Indien ingeschakeld zal de pomp automatisch hervatten, als je dit zelf vergeet te doen voordat het tijdelijk 0 basaal verloopt. Zolang het tijdelijk 0 basaal nog actief is, laat FreeAPS X de pomp opgeschort."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Многие люди иногда забывают возобновить подачу на помпе после повторного подключения. Если этот параметр включен, он автоматически возобновит / разблокирует помпу, если вы забыли сделать это до того, как срок ВБС истечет. До тех пор, пока ВБС работает, помпа будет приостановлена."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standardvärde Av för denna inställning. Alla eventuella temporära basaler som pågått under tider pumpen varit pausad kommer att raderas, dessutom kommer de ordinarie basaldoserna ersättas med temporära basaler på 0 IE/h."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Birçok kişi, pompayı yeniden bağladıktan sonra ara sıra pompasını çalıştırmayı / askıya alınmız pompayı tekrar çalıştırmayı unutur. Onlardan biriyseniz ve pompanızı askıya alırken ve bağlantısını keserken güvenilir bir şekilde sıfır geçici bazal ayarlamak istiyorsanız, bu özellik arkanızda. Etkinleştirildiği taktirde sıfır geçici oranı sona ermeden önce, pompayı otomatik olarak sürdürür / askıya alır. Sıfır geçici hala çalıştığı sürece, pompayı askıda bırakacaktır."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Many people occasionally forget to resume / unsuspend their pump after reconnecting it. If you’re one of them, and you are willing to reliably set a zero temp basal whenever suspending and disconnecting your pump, this feature has your back. If enabled, it will automatically resume / unsuspend the pump if you forget to do so before your zero temp expires. As long as the zero temp is still running, it will leave the pump suspended."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 默认为false。在泵被暂停期间，任何现有的临时基础率将被删除，并以空的基础率来抵消配置基础率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
