    "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes.": {
      "comment": "Half Basal Exercise Target",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf eine Wert setzen, z. B. 160, was bedeutet, wenn das Temp Ziel 160 mg/dL und der exercise_mode=an ist, laufen 50% basal auf diesem Level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). Dies kann angepasst werden, um Ihnen mehr Kontrolle über Ihre Übungsmodi zu geben."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The temp target value at which basal drops to 50%. Example: set to 160 — a temp target of 160 gives 50% basal, 140 gives 60%, 120 gives 75%. Adjust based on how much you drop during exercise."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Establecer a un número, p. ej. 160, lo que significaría que cuando el objetivo temporal es 160 mg/dL y el modo ejercicio esté activo, proporciona el 50% de la basal a este nivel (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). Esto puede ser ajustado para darle más control sobre sus modos de ejercicio."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Définit la valeur de glycémie à 50 % du niveau basal. Par ex. 160 signifie que lorsque la cible temporaire est de 160 mg/dL et exercise_mode=true, oref0 fixe la valeur basale à 50% de la valeur normale (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). Cela peut être ajusté, pour vous donner plus de contrôle sur vos modes d'exercice."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impostare ad un numero finito, ad es. 160, il che significa che quando il target glicemico temporaneo è 160 mg/dL e modalità_esercizio=true, esegue il 50% basale a questo livello (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). Questo può essere regolato, per darti più controllo sulle modalità di esercizio."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stel in op nummer, b.v. 160, wat betekent dat wanneer een tijdelijk streefdoel 160 mg/dL (9 mmol/l) en bewegingen_mode=true is, 50% basaal op dit niveau (120 (6,7) = 75%; 140 (7,8) = 60%). Dit kan worden aangepast, om u meer controle te geven over uw oefeningsmodi."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Значение временной цели, при которой базал снижается до 50%. Пример: установите 8.9 — цель 8.9 ммоль/л даёт 50% базала, 7.8 даёт 60%, 6.7 даёт 75%. Настройте в зависимости от того, как сильно падает глюкоза во время упражнений."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inställd till ett blodsockervärde, t.ex. 160 (mg/dl = 8.9 mmol/l), vilket innebär att när det temporära målvärdet är 8.9 mmol/l och 'Exercise Mode' är på, används endast en 50%-ig basal vid detta blodsocker (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). Detta kan justeras, för att ge dig mer kontroll över dina temporära målvärden vid träning."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bir sayıya ayarlayın, örn. 160, yani geçici hedef 160 mg/dL ve egzersiz_modu=açık olduğunda, bu seviyede %50 bazal çalıştırın (120 = %75; 140 = %60). Bu egzersiz modlarınız üzerinde daha fazla kontrol sahibi olmanız için ayarlanabilir."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to a number, e.g. 160, which means when temp target is 160 mg/dL and exercise_mode=true, run 50% basal at this level (120 = 75%; 140 = 60%). This can be adjusted, to give you more control over your exercise modes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置为一个数字，例如160，这意味着当临时目标为160毫克/分升，并且exercise_mode=true时，在这个水平上运行50%的基础（120=75%；140=60%）。这一点可以调整，以使你对运动模式有更多的控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
