    "Smallest SMB / SMB increment in oref0. Minimum amount for Medtronic pumps is 0.1 U, whereas for Omnipod it's 0.05 U. The default value is 0.1.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
