          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The other side of the autosens safety limits, putting a cap on how low autosens can adjust basals, and how high it can adjust ISF and BG targets."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El otro lado de los límites de seguridad de Autosens, poniendo un tope a cuán bajo Autosens puede ajustar basales, y cuán alto puede ajustar el factor de sensibilidad de la insulina y los objetivos de glucosa."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The other side of the autosens safety limits, putting a cap on how low autosens can adjust basals, and how high it can adjust ISF and BG targets."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'autre paramètre de sécurité de l'autosens, mettant un plafond sur la manière dont l'autosens faible peut ajuster les basals, et à quelle hauteur il peut ajuster les cibles ISF et Glycémie."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The other side of the autosens safety limits, putting a cap on how low autosens can adjust basals, and how high it can adjust ISF and BG targets."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un altro limite di sicurezza di autosens, imposta un blocco a quanto in basso autosens può regolare le basali e a quanto in alto può regolare ISF e target glicemici."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The other side of the autosens safety limits, putting a cap on how low autosens can adjust basals, and how high it can adjust ISF and BG targets."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De andere kant van de Autosens veiligheidslimiet, dit set een limiet op hoe laag Autosens de basaal kan zetten, hoe hoog het de ISF kan zetten en hoe hoog de streefwaarde ingesteld kan worden."
