        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a setting for default carb absorption impact per 5 minutes. The default is an expected 8 mg/dL/5min. This affects how fast COB is decayed in situations when carb absorption is not visible in BG deviations. The default of 8 mg/dL/5min corresponds to a minimum carb absorption rate of 24g/hr at a CSF of 4 mg/dL/g."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Это количество углеводов поглощаемых за 5 минут. По умолчанию ожидается 8 мг/дл/5 мин. Это влияет на быстроту списания углеводов алгоритмом в ситуациях, когда при отклонениях СК поглощение углеводов не заметно. По умолчанию 8 мг/дл/5 мин что соответствует минимальной скорости поглощения углеводов 24 г/ч при CSF в 4 мг/дл/г."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a setting for default carb absorption impact per 5 minutes. The default is an expected 8 mg/dL/5min. This affects how fast COB is decayed in situations when carb absorption is not visible in BG deviations. The default of 8 mg/dL/5min corresponds to a minimum carb absorption rate of 24g/hr at a CSF of 4 mg/dL/g."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standardvärde är 8 mg/dl/5min (0,4 mmol/l/5 min). Detta är en inställning för kolhydratsabsorptionseffekt per 5 minuter, som påverkar hur snabbt aktiva kolhydrater klingar av i situationer när kolhydratsabsorption inte syns i BS-avvikelser. Standarden på 0,4 mmol/l/5 min motsvarar en minsta absorptionshastighet på 24g/h vid en CSF ('Carb Sensitivity Factor', hur mycket ditt blodsocker stiger per gram kolhydrat) på 0,2 mmol/l/g."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu ayar 5 dakikada bir varsayılan karbonhidrat emilim etkisi için dır. Varsayılan, beklenen bir 8 mg/dL/5dk'dır. Bu, KŞ sapmalarında karbonhidrat emiliminin görünmediği durumlarda COB'nin ne kadar hızlı bozulduğunu etkiler. Varsayılan 8 mg/dL/5dk, 4 mg/dL/g'lik bir BOS'ta 24g/saatlik minimum karbonhidrat emilim oranına karşılık gelir."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a setting for default carb absorption impact per 5 minutes. The default is an expected 8 mg/dL/5min. This affects how fast COB is decayed in situations when carb absorption is not visible in BG deviations. The default of 8 mg/dL/5min corresponds to a minimum carb absorption rate of 24g/hr at a CSF of 4 mg/dL/g."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是对每5分钟默认碳水化合物吸收影响的设置。默认的预期是8毫克/分升/5分钟。这影响到在BG偏差中看不到碳水化合物吸收的情况下，COB衰减的速度。默认的8mg/dL/5min对应于CSF为4mg/dL/g时的最低碳水化合物吸收率为24g/hr。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune.": {
      "comment": "Max Daily Safety Multiplier",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies ist ein wichtiges OpenAPS-Sicherheitslimit. Die Standardeinstellung (die wahrscheinlich nicht angepasst werden muss) ist 3. Das bedeutet, dass es OpenAPS niemals erlaubt sein wird, eine temporäre Basalrate festzulegen, die mehr als das dreifache der höchsten Stunden-Basalrate ist, die in der Pumpe eines Benutzers gespeichert ist. Auch bei aktiviertem Autotune gilt diese Grenze."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este es un importante límite de seguridad de OpenAPS. La configuración predeterminada (que es poco probable que necesite ajustarse) es 3. Esto significa que OpenAPS nunca podrá establecer una tasa basal temporal que sea más de 3 veces la tasa basal más alta programada en una bomba de usuario o, si está activado, determinado por autotune."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ceci est une limite de sécurité importante pour OpenAPS. Le paramètre par défaut ( peu susceptible d'avoir besoin d'être ajusté) est 3. Cela signifie qu’OpenAPS ne sera jamais autorisé à définir un débit basal temporaire supérieur à 3 fois le taux de basal horaire le plus élevé programmé dans la pompe d’un utilisateur, ou, si activé, déterminé par autotune."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo è un importante limite di sicurezza di OpenAPS. L'impostazione predefinita (che è improbabile che debba essere modificata) è 3. Ciò significa che a OpenAPS non sarà mai permesso di impostare una velocità basale temporanea superiore a 3x la più alta velocità basale oraria programmata nella pompa di un utente, o, se abilitato, determinato da autotune."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dit is een belangrijke OpenAPS veiligheidslimiet. De standaardinstelling (die waarschijnlijk geen aanpassingen nodig zal hebben) is 3. Dit betekent dat OpenAPS nooit zal worden toegestaan om een tijdelijke basaalstand in te stellen die groter is dan 3 x de hoogste basaalstand per uur, geprogrammeerd in een gebruikerspomp, of indien ingeschakeld, bepaald door autotune."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
